a","Dramma","Storia"],"countries":["Latvia"],"facts":{"Runtime":"124m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":2891194,"name":"Oto Brantevics","role":"Arturs Vanags","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2KW1ccX3sWoXZ7TnZ3Xl6w9ztS2.jpg"},{"id":1192363,"name":"Vilis Daudziņš","role":"Col. Sala","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jlSv8kelT8MkWuWxXDdE84VBvoU.jpg"},{"id":1702174,"name":"Ivars Krasts","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gsscyBPqDAPVSoXTiBGq1zpIIhl.jpg"},{"id":1466293,"name":"Gatis Gāga","role":"Konrads","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2MMpuCYeX8YQrHJ29QnqIgHdk51.jpg"},{"id":929706,"name":"Martins Vilsons","role":"Vanags","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zHp5Ov8S2LuOhLJPoU2txxUdIkD.jpg"},{"id":1579800,"name":"Rēzija Kalniņa","role":"Mother","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fnnjGkptx2nowWF8X9ZcPeiIo28.jpg"},{"id":1921856,"name":"Raimonds Celms","role":"Edgars Vanags","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wrdvypD7KZDD2U5ReqsdQUz4Pf1.jpg"},{"id":2192067,"name":"Jēkabs Reinis","role":"Mikelsons","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4f2bhT02TGGD2lyQYtDA0LFCpvd.jpg"},{"id":2055758,"name":"Ieva Florence-Vīksne","role":"Mirdza","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b0K2ek5A9bE7CzLI6RRtGkmEJW9.jpg"},{"id":2905913,"name":"Renārs Zeltiņš","role":"Spilva"},{"id":2905914,"name":"Grēta Trušiņa","role":"Marta"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"The Rifleman","overview":"La storia d'amore del sedicenne Arturs è interrotta dalla prima guerra mondiale. Dopo aver perso sua madre e la sua casa, trova una certa consolazione nell'arruolarsi nell'esercito, perché questa è la prima volta che i battaglioni nazionali sono ammessi nell'Impero russo. Ma la guerra non è affatto come Arturs l'aveva immaginata: niente gloria, niente equità. È brutale e dolorosa. Arturs è ora completamente solo mentre la guerra si prende le vite di suo padre e di suo fratello. Inoltre, nessun progresso viene fatto nella promessa di una rapida risoluzione della guerra e di un tempestivo ritorno a casa. Con l'idea che solo lui si preoccupa di tornare a casa e che la sua patria è solo un parco giochi per altre nazioni, Arturs trova la forza per la battaglia finale e alla fine torna a casa per ricominciare tutto da zero, proprio come il suo paese appena nato."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Rifleman","overview":"The love story of sixteen-year-old Arturs is interrupted by the First World War. After losing his mother and his home, he finds some consolation in joining the army, because this is the first time national battalions are allowed in the Russian Empire. But war is nothing like Arturs imagined – no glory, no fairness. It is brutal and painful. Arturs is now completely alone as war takes the lives of his father and brother. Also, no progress is made in the promised quick resolution of the war and timely return home. Within the notion that only he alone cares about returning home and that his homeland is just a playground for other nations, Arturs finds strength for the final battle and eventually returns home to start everything from scratch, just like his newly born country."},{"language":"lv-LV","overview":"Filma “Dvēseļu putenis” atspoguļo latviešu tautas cīņu par neatkarību un to, ka Latvijas valsts esamība nav pašsaprotama. Mūsu brīvība ir nopelnīta ar pašaizliedzību un visdārgāko ziedojumu - cilvēku dzīvībām. Filma izved cauri vēsturiskajiem notikumiem, padarot tos par personīgo pieredzi. Tā ir stāsts par latviešu saknēm un Latvijas valsts vērtībām. “Dvēseļu putenis” ir mūsu pateicība cilvēkiem, kuru izvēles toreiz ļauj mums dzīvot neatkarīgā valstī šodien.”"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hVLXwfawIYdGhwU6IJ2soO0gdLC.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zhr06iXdSAXbGMrodUTCA4o9FC